{"4714880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skapheim: The Tenth Realm", "steam_appid": 4714880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5108300], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Realm Worthy of a Name</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skapheim: The Tenth Realm is a roguelike city-builder where every hex matters. Draft terrain, buildings, contracts, and obelisks from the Nornir’s Market, then turn a small patch of the Void into a realm strong enough to survive Odin’s judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/30bb6361a06356e87ed6a6c8caa2a0f8.poster.avif?t=1787953121\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/30bb6361a06356e87ed6a6c8caa2a0f8.webm?t=1787953121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/30bb6361a06356e87ed6a6c8caa2a0f8.mp4?t=1787953121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Powerful Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect roads, shape rivers, settle forests and mountains, and place buildings where their bonuses matter most. Every placement can strengthen nearby structures, complete a contract, or prepare a much larger score later. Build for the current season—or sacrifice short-term gains for a run-defining combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/5042eefa0406d302ec7979d79b61e674.poster.avif?t=1787953121\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/5042eefa0406d302ec7979d79b61e674.webm?t=1787953121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/5042eefa0406d302ec7979d79b61e674.mp4?t=1787953121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Rules of Every Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts reward challenging objectives with new bonuses. Obelisks score season after season and transform the value of your realm. Adapt to a shifting market, discover new strategies, and turn whatever fate offers into a working engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/485837715f80b7471f074ea005298c59.poster.avif?t=1787953121\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/485837715f80b7471f074ea005298c59.webm?t=1787953121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714880/extras/485837715f80b7471f074ea005298c59.mp4?t=1787953121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Turning Seasons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each year ends with Odin measuring your realm’s Worth: Prosperity multiplied by Stability. Meet the rising target to continue. Fall short, and the Void takes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused 10–30 minute runs make every defeat a lesson—and every new realm another chance to earn your name.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Realm Worthy of a Name</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skapheim: The Tenth Realm is a roguelike city-builder where every hex matters. Draft terrain, buildings, contracts, and obelisks from the Nornir’s Market, then turn a small patch of the Void into a realm strong enough to survive Odin’s judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\